{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30236","headline":"九日雨中言怀 · 薛逢","name":"九日雨中言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"餻果盈前益自愁，那堪风雨滞刀州。\n单牀冷席他乡梦，紫榝黄花故国秋。\n万里音书何寂寂，百年生计甚悠悠。\n潜将满眼思家泪，洒寄长江东北流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}